  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC01-C_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So now this Medulla has the girl that could destroy the Spiral! Has our work here been for naught? Greys'in, what do you know of their plans?",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Khan_EMP_121.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254433,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC16_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Well, Bat always said they needed Mellori and her Luminiferous Essence to break the three Paradox Chains and free the Chaos Heart.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Alphoi_Bat_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Greysin_EMP_04.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254378,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "That's why they came to Zanadu - to learn how to extract that Essence. Now that they know, they'll make for one of the Chains. But which one?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Pig_Crewman_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Beans_EMP_29.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254354,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC16_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Well, Bat did mention a scheme he was cooking up on Athanor... something about 'sowing chaos'. Oh! The Chain of Fire and Ice is there!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Alphoi_Bat_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Greysin_EMP_05.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254378,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Then we must get to this Athanor place at once- oh wait... Does anyone know how we get to this Athanor place?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Pig_Captain_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Pork_EMP_147.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254352,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Captain, I have made great progress with my Streamportal network. I am relatively confident I can get us to Athanor from the Ark.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Crewman_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sparck_EMP_112.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254357,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC01-C_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "May the Light guide you, Captain Pork.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Alphoi_King_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Khan_EMP_122.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254433,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Underway",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
